### 5. Get Document Categories
GET {{host}}/api/documents/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get Engagement Documents
GET {{host}}/api/documents/engagement/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Upload Document (Multipart Form Data)
# Note: Ensure you have a 'test.pdf' file located at the root of the pdr-app folder
POST {{host}}/api/documents/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dtos[0].EngagementId"

1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dtos[0].CategoryId"

1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dtos[0].File"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../../test.pdf
--boundary--

### 8. Download Document
# Replace '1' with a valid document ID returned from upload or list
GET {{host}}/api/documents/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Delete Document
# Replace '1' with a valid document ID
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

